[15.94,"o","\u001b[1mHow these numbers were made\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.04,"o","  Billed totals: recorded usage in your logs, deduplicated, priced at list prices.\r\n"]
[16.14,"o","  Context split: o200k_base token counts, calibrated to each Claude model's usage: claude-fable-5 ×1.62 (good, n=1101); claude-fable-5-1 ×1.42 (fair, n=153); claude-opus-4-8 ×1.56 (good, via claude 4.7+ tokenizer n=26817); claude-opus-5 ×1.39 (fair, n=3152); claude-opus-5-5 ×1.55 (good, n=22398).\r\n"]
[16.24,"o","  OpenAI models: o200k_base is their tokenizer (assumed for gpt-6).\r\n"]
[16.34,"o","  Claude Code attachments are sized from their stored fields; system prompt and tool definitions are not logged.\r\n"]
[16.44,"o","  Savers: offline replay cannot show whether a saver changes how the agent behaves\r\n"]
[16.54,"o","  (extra turns, retries, recalls, answer quality). Savings assume the same cache pattern.\r\n"]
[16.64,"o","  Priced as: codex-auto-review → gpt-5.6-luna (no public price).\r\n"]
[16.74,"o","  Prices: snapshot of 2026-09-25 (models.dev). Refresh with --update-prices (network).\r\n"]
